        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Hitman 9. Episode 5. Last dance",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ELEGANT_LLAMA",
        "PublicId": "131106211020",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository adae1c21-fe5e-4027-b4c4-760ad5fd632c).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. Today you return to Mendoza, Argentina, where a dance of rich and political figures is being held. However, the focus of the evening is one couple, Tom Holland and his future wife Isobel Riley. They are known as &quot;businessmen working together&quot;. However, in reality, underneath it all, they are involved in criminal networks and money laundering. Our client wants us to eliminate him with a sniper rifle, so that in the end it will be clear that their deaths were wanted. Good luck.",
